      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE            DRAYTON BEAUCHAMP       DRAYTON BEAUCHAMP                                             east side 5/69                                        The Cottage II House. C17 altered; timber framed with brick infill, partly faced in old red brick. Thatched roof. 2 brick chimneys. L-shaped block, 2-storeys, projecting wing to LH has 2 and 3-light casements to ground floor and 3-light upper casement, mostly with modern leaded glazing, and single brick segmental 2-light casements, with l-light upper casement in centre. N. elevation has 2 bays of exposed framing, door to LH, irregular windows. RCHM I p.137 MON.6. Listing NGR: SP8983312611"
    }
